Name: libbase
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/libbase
Version: N/A
Revision: a5c86f3574f744b22a82a8cd08e7fa0bf7210c28
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: //third_party/libunwindstack/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Common helpers from AOSP (android-base): files, strings, logging macros,
unique_fd. libunwindstack, libdexfile and libartbase include them as
"android-base/...", and //third_party/libunwindstack builds them into its
libunwindstack and posix_strerror_r targets.

src/ holds the files BUILD.gn lists, from the upstream repository root.
Patches 0001, 0003, 0007 and 0015 in patches/ change some of them.
Chromium also added two #include lines to logging.h and strings.h
without a patch (libunwindstack.git dcd4e94).

To update, copy those files at the new revision into src/, reapply the
changes above, and update Revision.
